===Etymology===
From {{w|West Germanic}} ''*ōþil'', from a variant of {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*ōþalą}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|ēthel}}, {{cog|osx|ōthil}}, {{cog|goh|uodil}}, {{cog|non|óðal}}.

